<title>USA: Buffets Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Buffets Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE, Minn. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.69   profit	 $0.18</p>
<p> Net	loss	   30,989   profit	 8,351</p>
<p> Revs		     180,909		  162,860</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,073		   45,439</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 loss includes after-tax, non-cash and merger charge of $32.7 million, or $0.71 a share.</p>
<p>Q3 1996 oper profit before non-cash and merger charges was $0.13 a share.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 loss	   $0.22   profit	 $0.56</p>
<p> Net	 loss	   9,942   profit	25,509</p>
<p> Revs		     580,663		  497,154</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,490		   45,279</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 results include $0.71 a share non-cash and merger charge.</p>
<p>Excluding charge, nine-month 1996 earnings were $0.50 a share vs $0.56, including common stock equivalents.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
